      "channel": "Stable",
      "release_notes": "**Changes:**\r\n- Migrated fully to Shoko Server's native `IMylistService`, eliminating the need for manual XML/TGZ export downloads and legacy API calls.\r\n- Introduced an interactive dashboard direction toggle to easily switch between export (`AniDB <- Shoko`) and import (`AniDB -> Shoko`) modes, alongside a configurable \"Update States\" option.\r\n- Enhanced action logging and reports to automatically resolve human-readable series titles, season/episode coordinates, and file identifiers using `IMetadataService`.\r\n- Added dynamic razor page templating (`ServePage`) for automated base URL injection and dynamic footer versioning.\r\n- Replaced manual extension switches with `FileExtensionContentTypeProvider` for robust, native MIME type resolution across web assets and fonts.\r\n- Hardened background task execution with safe exception handling and thread-safe queue polling to prevent task lockups.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/natyusha/ShokoMyListSyncPlus/compare/v1.0.4...v2.0.0",
