      "release_notes": "**Changes**\r\n- Replace unreliable IsWatched property evaluation with a strict LastPlayedAt null check in MylistSyncWorker\r\n- Ensure the log reports and SyncState arrays correctly reflect the true local watched state\r\n- Add scanning logic to detect episodes watched on AniDB but unwatched in Shoko\r\n- Output a purely informational section to the final report log for AniDB-watched episodes\r\n- Output a summary count of these ignored episodes to the live dashboard log pane\r\n- Remove unused .api-svg class from style.css\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/natyusha/ShokoMyListSyncPlus/compare/v1.0.0...v1.0.1",
